WEBVTT

00:06:58.164 --> 00:07:01.500
that it is possible to be someone
who does something

00:07:01.542 --> 00:07:04.587
but doesn't have
an accompanying sense of agency.

00:07:05.379 --> 00:07:09.508
So just like the narrative self
and the sense of ownership of body parts,

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:12.094
the sense of agency
is also a construction,

00:07:12.136 --> 00:07:13.804
and it, too, can fail.

00:07:14.138 --> 00:07:16.223
So you can see where this is going.

00:07:17.099 --> 00:07:19.685
Let me take one more example
to drive home this point.

00:07:19.685 --> 00:07:24.273
Let's talk of what it feels
to be a body here and now.

00:07:25.483 --> 00:07:27.151
Not the feeling of being a story,

00:07:27.193 --> 00:07:30.029
but the feeling of being a body
in the present moment.